No patient data
---------------
This repository contains code only. The gated challenge dataset (variant
call format files, phenotype records) and all derived genotype-scale
outputs are excluded via .gitignore and are deleted per the hackathon's
30-day data-deletion rule. Nothing here can re-identify the data subject
beyond what the family has already shared publicly.
